{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1100469-ooc-innocents-through-darkness","id":1100469,"title":"[OOC] [Innocents] Through Darkness","path":["Home","Onyx Path","General","Conventions, Gatherings, and Online Play","Play by Post"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-06-05T09:23:01-07:00","id":1100469,"title":"[OOC] [Innocents] Through Darkness","content":"<u><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Through Darkness</span></u><br /> <br /> This is the Out of Character thread for discussing our chronicles. We will discuss characters and thematic concepts here, as well as any issues that come up during gameplay.<br /> <br /> Children are the most honest beings in our world. Children won't lie to you about the things they see. Unfortunately, adults don't often taken them seriously.<br /> <br /> You will each be pulled beyond the veil that hides the monsters from humanity. Your innocence will be tainted. Welcome to the World of Darkness.<br /> <br /> You are children, beginning aged 12 - 14, living in the sleepy town of Solemn Falls. In the current year, Solemn Falls isn't a frequented town by travelers. It's twenty miles from the next big Washington state city. The town's inhabitants are mainly middle to upper-class people, and a quarter of them are eccentrics. This is a town where people might choose to retire in, or raise a family.<br /> <br /> Things to note is that Solemn Falls is home to a gentleman's society known as the Spalding Society. There are also tenured artists that put on exhibits three times a year, usually spear-headed by the uncannily talented artist known as James Abramovic, who also teaches at the local youth club. <br /> <br /> There is an immense wooded area northwest of the town where the daring like to camp out. A portion of the woodland is a nature preserve, run by a group of native american shamans that tend to keep to themselves. It is known that one of them is a government official trying to move up in office. <br /> <br /> The city has an older sewer systems with expansive tunnels that run throughout downtown, and somewhat through the city suburbs. It's rumored that some of these tunnels lead to paths not marked on any of the woodlands maps. Explore if you've got the guts for it. <br /> <br /> <b>Players (full) </b><br /> 1. TheHouse<br /> 2. Marcmanonlyme<br /> 3. Shawarbaaz (Arby)<br /> 4. Horace Tabor <br /> <br /> IC Thread","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12742,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12742-doggo","user":"Doggo","date":". 07-06-2017, 09:41 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12742-doggo","name":"Doggo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12742_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"36"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-06T17:29:06-07:00","id":1101035,"title":"","content":"That's new, never seen anyone trying to start an Innocents game before, count me in","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12561-shawarbaaz","name":"Shawarbaaz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12561_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"467"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-07T18:28:49-07:00","id":1101442,"title":"","content":"I'm phlegmthemandragon from Reddit, I'd still love to join!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13549-thehouse","name":"TheHouse","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-08T00:25:51-07:00","id":1101518,"title":"","content":"Hi there, I contacted you in Reddit, I can't subscribe but here I am retiring for duty","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13550-marcmanonlyme","name":"marcmanonlyme","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-08T07:50:01-07:00","id":1101637,"title":"","content":"Hey House, Marc. I added you to the list. I'm going to give our third time to show up. If not, I'll move forward with another player.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12742-doggo","name":"Doggo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12742_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"36"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-09T12:04:18-07:00","id":1102063,"title":"","content":"Hey fellas. What's happening? Let's get some conversation going. What theme and mood should I story start as, and what characters do you want to play? <br /> <br /> Shawarbaaz, I'll add you to the roster. Our third has yet to respond, so count yourself in.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12742-doggo","name":"Doggo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12742_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"36"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-10T00:23:04-07:00","id":1102210,"title":"","content":"I'd prefer